        <span class="chip"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="5.5"/><path d="M8 5v3.5l2.5 1.5"/></svg><span>Draft</span></span>
        
        <span class="chip">public</span>
        
      </div>
      <h1>Synthetic procedure for running a business-system review</h1>
      <div class="meta-row">
  <span>As of <time datetime="2026-02-01">2026-02-01</time></span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span>Review by <time datetime="2026-07-31">2026-07-31</time></span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span><b>1 of 1</b> claims supported</span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  
  <span>Last verified <time datetime="2026-02-10">2026-02-10</time></span>
  
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span>Readiness <b>SYNTHETIC-NOW</b></span>
  <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
  <span class="mono">cmp-review-steps</span>
</div>
      <div class="page-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn sm" id="fb:copyLinkBtn" data-copy-link="cmp-review-steps">Copy link</button>
        <div class="seg" id="fb:wordingSeg" role="group" aria-label="Wording">
          <button type="button" data-wording="both" aria-pressed="true">Both</button>
          <button type="button" data-wording="plain" aria-pressed="false">Plain</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    
    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="purpose">
      <h2 id="purpose">Purpose</h2>
      
      <p>Describe the synthetic step-by-step procedure for completing a <span class="term" data-pv="term:system_review" data-pv-title="system review" data-pv-body="Synthetic periodic assessment of business-system control operation.">system review</span>.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="the-rule">
      <h2 id="the-rule">The rule</h2>
      
      <p>Complete the synthetic review within the 30 days window <a id="cite-ref-1-1" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a>.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
      
      <ol>
<li>Open the synthetic control checklist and gather the sample logs.</li>
<li>Verify each synthetic control checkpoint against the <a class="plink" href="cmp-system-review.html" data-pv="page:cmp-system-review" data-pv-title="Synthetic business-system review and withholding overview" data-pv-body="Explain how a synthetic system review interacts with a synthetic billing withhold.">review concept</a>.</li>
<li>Record the synthetic sign-off outcome before the billing cutoff.</li>
</ol>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="worked-example">
      <h2 id="worked-example">Worked example</h2>
      
      <p>Synthetic example. The numbers are made up.</p>
<p>A synthetic team checks 12 sample vouchers across 3 days and closes all findings.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="never-confuse">
      <h2 id="never-confuse">Never confuse</h2>
      
      <p>Do not confuse this synthetic procedure with external audit sampling.</p>

      
      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="company-calibration">
      <h2 id="company-calibration">Company calibration</h2>
      
      <details class="fold company-fold">
        <summary><b>Company questions</b> <span class="meta">1 to settle with company data</span></summary>
      
      
      <p>Verify which role signs the synthetic review checklist <span class="cite neutral" data-pv="q:Q-001" data-pv-title="Q-001" data-pv-body="Which synthetic business-system control owner approves the monthly compliance review?">Q-001</span>.</p>

      
      
